#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:39
msgid "Understanding Altitude in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的高度理解"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:5
#: 05ba3705532c43f2b61751839d06317c 104670e67e0544dea496861052cd243e
#: 21bd12bb1fc74d009e2da1809168bbc1 32ae55b96d304f8eae40971c1e60093f
#: 8a06e59fec8c41b9bf073910cd936c45 9acc5eec56c54894b6612f187ebf4b85
#: d36c3f9111044ae1aa3cfd3e564d7c46 f664b374745b4f1dabc46a89f9413e4a
msgid "RangeFinders Setup Overview"
msgstr "测距仪设置概览"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:7
#: 0043d51988524500bf6fa0a255782d48 004e2252a7b94291b48034e4558fd3fb
#: 4d6c9d4caabc4696bba8eb87ed50ffbe 78a9861315dc46e5bc45b2010c33c98b
#: 8828a6c6fab845e2b5d11dc7bba46e2b 95f417cba95c48388c89ca74a2b2c032
#: 963919dc9b804ba2a5aacf3987187893 c59a2cdb38e14005967dcecea21b2a2c
msgid ""
"There are many different kinds of rangefinders: Lidar (using laser or infra-"
"red light to measure distance), Sonar (using ultrasonic sound), and Radar "
"(using microwave RF). Some are analog, producing  pulses whose timing "
"represent the distance to an object, others are digital sending data streams"
" over serial to UARTs, or I2C, or even via DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"测距仪有多种类型：激光雷达（利用激光或红外光测距）、声呐（利用超声波）和雷达（利用微波射频）。部分为模拟型，通过脉冲时序表示与目标的距离；其他为数字型，通过串口、I2C"
" 或 DroneCAN 发送数据流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:9
#: 1992de968d1f4a42a450e5e0af7e68c4 667d3db4f0824af9bd73a8d91757fa32
#: 8e5442f759154392846565379eece1d6 a3b4626fe4414a559c9332df08bf02f4
#: ad0f8461da1e4822ae786a6e728ea5ab bea3698111f243edbbb80d85e124de61
#: eba1abcfce0f4fa4a3c823fd1e659528 f6b6c33742604921b7ff3f5c27133701
msgid ""
":ref:`RangeFinders (Sonar or Lidar) <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` can be"
" used for :ref:`Object Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` as "
"well as altitude sensors for precision landing in Plane and Copter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`测距仪（声呐或激光雷达）<common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 可用于 :ref:`避障 <common-"
"object-avoidance-landing-page>` 以及 Plane 和 Copter 精准降落时的高度传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:15
#: 1d3c4d44326d4c648c670e6bc29d8364 4e7e9ca539d6490b95cb726c840c6878
#: 608788e825ba4dc3b48256c879926ff8 6c66d1460ad1481298d85b5d0f2ac62f
#: 704730a40dbd45539d0136689b06dbe5 b6e7c304326d4cd48eac076882888ca5
#: b9e22867000542b4ae63dbf3c12ba5d0 c74c8bc35a244185a7f6c65d0b6226c4
msgid ""
":ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` features are new and should be "
"used with caution."
msgstr ":ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` 功能为新特性，使用时应保持谨慎。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:18
#: 44ec7f87cf67401a95b1fd2bd563bcb2 6e87ae13b71d4f7fbe3e2db4bb592591
#: 701b452cccbe4b1cb793f9e1dc573430 973f242da767487c855a82010c928291
#: be4581386982448d9b6ffdd6491b0ee7 c3f6b250af1e44f4acef8ac2c6f4c68c
#: ede5208ea0424f67a39da0124d1f5941 f89eeda579e74e74978ab5ad833dcf5b
msgid ""
"Up to 10 Rangefinders can be used in the system (1 thru A). :ref:`Object "
"Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` can use a single 360 "
"degree Lidar, or up to 9 unidirectional rangefinders: 8 arranged in a circle"
" covering 45 degree wide segments, plus an upward facing rangefinder. And a "
"downward facing rangefinder used for low altitude height above ground "
"measurements."
msgstr ""
"系统最多可使用 10 个测距仪（编号 1 至 A）。:ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` "
"可使用单个 360 度激光雷达，或最多 9 个单向测距仪：8 个呈圆形排列，每个覆盖 45 "
"度扇区，加上一个朝上测距仪。另有一个向下测距仪用于低空离地高度测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:21
#: 13f9d17715764ba9972b5cfbe3c059d5 16c1c6329ddb40f09f8a5ee4a1d1cb2b
#: 2b7ef693cf394be29e3b7a4fe6b0b93d 372564db9ea149fa9b1c067d1b0b34d0
#: 536271c3e6fe4be6a4ceac8220ca341c 55891adaae4a45fba29301d71e972d1a
#: b4c8e34e3f0d4820afa479a18198c4a8 b9a37f6350ad47cda924aede6f01e4c0
msgid "Connecting and Configuring the Rangefinder"
msgstr "连接和配置测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:23
#: 358d500534d7476c837f35cdee0753b5 59c2d8ec76e34d8fb511c7a4c4c5388d
#: 60c7d591c79342919e4dbbc84f121be2 6ace3f9b1c7e4e9c9b20ca1cd07d8c26
#: 7dc75af3f4d8461a8aed238d430d513d 86e5cb05dcbf48c4a199f00d40b974a6
#: b55428cc087b4b6cb9838840f7b5a578 c14044ede8ad452a86d19d6374cf4dff
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions for each type of rangefinder described in its linked"
" page on :ref:`common-rangefinder-landingpage`."
msgstr "请按照 :ref:`common-rangefinder-landingpage` 上各类测距仪链接页面中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:24
#: 045b6b79a2374603b5d222b56e46ab37 0aec9c1ae0644bebb9f5c0cf6934456c
#: 1010f15e016e4169a12285a3bbbb8ead 3510eea94ed648c7b1db5202931aad96
#: b6f7608ca1394cbbacd336d292d9e151 cb50e5698f654358aa440b462bcab77b
#: d58c0f2ec4fa44349ecf76b9eb121bd0 ee9eb3510230437e8d86a4d7511ae163
msgid ""
"Set the RNGFNDx_ORIENT parameters (i.e. :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT "
"<RNGFND1_ORIENT>`, :ref:`RNGFND2_ORIENT <RNGFND2_ORIENT>`, etc.) to specify "
"the direction each range finder is pointing in."
msgstr ""
"设置 RNGFNDx_ORIENT 参数（即 :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT "
"<RNGFND1_ORIENT>`、:ref:`RNGFND2_ORIENT <RNGFND2_ORIENT>` 等）以指定每个测距仪的朝向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:26
#: 2ac8ae13b8c3467a8be6e8a368af2f37 308c703a06dd43069868d5b0574ce43a
#: 3c2296ae5c044befb2fc409492a33a93 84f5eecb8e7d47339f535f06df82a692
#: cd75f532d27644aa9d68f86e3c1c3ff4 cfcb1d98c8654197a15ccb5dcb4d9765
#: e3379be10bc949eb99c98f4e55c94774 ea458a3cbfd148b0b362d78e760b5093
msgid ""
"Note that if the type of rangefinder is set or changed, a reboot will be "
"required."
msgstr "请注意，若更改测距仪类型设置，需要重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:30
#: 2e9f1c4efdae496f8784e64a0c707854 b04fd95e51f34a329832c6904b64d302
#: cdaec65b06b6438194f403b516b35510 f7387c05e2484bf3948bf35172c1a81a
msgid ""
"Set the parameter ``PRXx_TYPE`` = 4 for each horizontal rangefinder(s) to "
"use them as Proximity Sensors (For obstacle avoidance)."
msgstr "将每个水平方向测距仪的参数 ``PRXx_TYPE`` 设置为 4，以将其用作近距传感器（用于避障）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:31
#: 2a3d4d528bea4d3e8718c7f5bc4af168 47f870f11d8f446aab69736931704f5a
#: bb7e02e9887c4cdcb3889e5a749f2900 d8f3400214b0475dac325965c7b9f2b2
msgid ""
"For Copter and Rover, up to 8 rangefinders may placed around the vehicle to "
"provide 360 degree coverage, or a single 360 degree Lidar. But only one "
"forward facing rangefinder is required for :ref:`Object Avoidance <common-"
"object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和 Rover，最多可在飞行器周围布置 8 个测距仪以提供 360 度全向覆盖，或使用单个 360 度激光雷达。但 :ref:`避障"
" <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` 只需一个前向测距仪即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:32
#: 50ba3e52900745de993ef2366852eb19 a58f39a86c884896af47258fa7dc3308
#: c63ad6fb6a7f4577a6905ae6851a63fc d9fcdeb747874aa39303219153dc83cc
msgid ""
"If a rangefinder is oriented facing up, then it will be used in the "
":ref:`common-simple-object-avoidance` operation as an upwards sensing "
"proximity sensor in Copter LOITER, ALTHOLD, and POSHOLD modes."
msgstr ""
"若测距仪朝上安装，则将在 Copter 的 Loiter、AltHold 和 PosHold 模式中作为向上探测的近距传感器用于 "
":ref:`common-simple-object-avoidance` 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:35
#: 3e5cb00f10f24fe996528fca2d43bd23 6dce188720cc47dead9e56e3b28ebec2
msgid ""
"If a rangefinder is oriented facing down, it will  be used to for height "
"above ground measurements when within its range for increased landing "
"precision in Copter, and in Plane autotakeoffs/autolandings, and QuadPlane "
"VTOL operations depending on which bits in the "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` parameter are set. In Copter, when "
"landing and within 10m of the ground according to the range finder, the "
"vehicle will slow its descent to the :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` (which "
"defaults to 50cm/s). In Plane, see the \"using a rangefinder\" section of "
":ref:`automatic-landing`"
msgstr ""
"若测距仪朝下安装，则在其量程内用于测量离地高度，以提高 Copter 降落精度，以及 Plane 自动起飞/降落和 QuadPlane VTOL "
"操作时的精度，具体取决于 :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` 参数中设置的位。在 Copter "
"降落过程中，当测距仪显示距地面 10m 以内时，飞行器将把下降速度降至 :ref:`LAND_SPEED<LAND_SPEED>` （默认 "
"50cm/s）。Plane 请参阅 :ref:`automatic-landing` 中的「使用测距仪」章节。"

